{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873860/extras/ea538e152e41c93cdffa10c7f21a64f1.avif?t=1759542188\" width=480 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873860/extras/d0b5f3107cef28b519b229956e0b759f.webp?t=1759542188\" width=336 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique puzzle categories</strong>. There are currently six themed categories with a total of 54 puzzles, and more to come with each update!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Sudoku puzzles</strong>. Choose between farming elements or standard numbers for your puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play\u00a0at\u00a0your\u00a0own\u00a0level</strong>. Options available to hide the timer, highlight rows and columns, or automatically show incorrect answers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles, get coins</strong>. Each puzzle gets you acorns to use to expand your farm!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adopt animals</strong>. Spend acorns to summon new animals to your farm!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your farm</strong>. Decorate your farm how you see fit! Choose seasons, time of day, weather, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original music</strong>. Composed exclusively with DX7 patches to give a retro vibe to the soundtrack!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I Like Animals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2873860/e02118d71d5aea657c3d122ec268bad23359f26d.jpg"},{"name":"Caught 'em all!",